; The entity sprite. Generated art from tools/art/generate_sprites.py, not a
; third-party pack: Kenney's top-down characters are all the same
; human-from-above oval and fail this project's silhouette requirement
; (LEDGER F03-21). Native size, no scale override, matching
; scenes/player.tscn -- the generator sizes each sprite to its own body
; radius, so the visual overhang is already consistent across entities.
; No z_index here: the `Entities` container supplies z_index 20 and the
; Y-sort group (docs/20 > Scene Tree; Register > Readability).
